h establishment of sister chromatid cohesion. May induce apoptosis in collaboration with APAF1 (PubMed:25716227)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_03","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}